@startuml deployment
title Vista de despliegue - Modelo de despliegue (Minikube)

node "Cluster Minikube" {
  node "Pod users-app" as usersapp
  node "Pod users-db" as usersdb

  node "Pod routes-app" as routesapp
  node "Pod routes-db" as routesdb

  node "Pod posts-app" as postsapp
  node "Pod posts-db" as postsdb

  node "Pod offers-app" as offersapp
  node "Pod offers-db" as offersdb
}

usersapp --> usersdb : TCP 5432
routesapp --> routesdb : TCP 5432
postsapp --> postsdb : TCP 5432
offersapp --> offersdb : TCP 5432

usersapp -[hidden]-> routesapp
routesapp -[hidden]-> postsapp
postsapp -[hidden]-> offersapp

note right of usersapp
  Service tipo NodePort
  expone el API REST
  fuera del clúster
end note

note right of usersdb
  Service tipo ClusterIP,
  volumen emptyDir,
  solo accesible desde
  su aplicación dueña
end note

@enduml
